      },
      "context": "system — floating assistant on every page outside /main — Bottom-right button on the landing, auth, legal, verify, 404, error and offline pages of web-player (not inside the player, where it would cover the player bar) and on every page of the artist portal. It expands into a 380×540 chat on desktop and a full-screen sheet on phones. While a request runs a thinking orb shows the phase: searching the docs, then composing. Answers cite the help centre under the reply. When the assistant cannot help it hands the chat to the Bitrate team: the status line says an operator will reply, and their replies arrive in the same chat. Never ask for passwords or payment data. Behind NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPPORT_CHAT_ENABLED / VITE_SUPPORT_CHAT_ENABLED until launch (#572)."
    },
